source_reference = "Hyzer Flip author-authored gameplay calibration for the fictional Ol Reliable distance driver. Its positive high-speed moment promotes a flip, while a bounded negative low-speed moment curve produces its fade as airspeed falls. Values are calibrated for angular-momentum precession and aerodynamic spin damping; both curves are evaluated from air-relative speed, so the relationship remains compatible with future wind. This is not measured aerodynamic data; replace it with independently collected or separately licensed validation data before release."
